  "solution": "Từ bảng xét dấu ta thấy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></semantics></math> luôn âm với mọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên hệ số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Trong các phương án đã cho, chỉ tam thức bậc hai <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
